er titan form to transport  the members of the group who are unable  to fight  pique tries to advise falco greece  against joining the battle but the youth  chooses to ignore her peak leaves the  non-combatants on a boat in the harbor  and engages the jaegerists herself she  is joined by falco and the two quickly  wipe out the remaining gagarists as the  group prepares to leave falco begins  losing control of his titan form and  pique attempts to talk him down talking  proves futile and falco attacks peak  forcing her to subdue him while macguth  cuts him out of its titan the ordeal  leaves pique badly injured and she has  to be carried onto the boat by hange  as they escape from the harbor a  grieving peak embraces gappy as they  witness general mcgoth sacrifice himself  by blowing up a marlin cruiser on the  dock  after arriving in odaho peak attempts to  comfort falco after informing him of  magoth's death and liberio's destruction  afterwards hearing that levi is planning  to interrogate yelena pique volunteers  to join  after getting elena to reveal aaron's  next destination  pique informs kiyomi that she intends to  lock gabby and falco in their room on  the ship so that they cannot board the  flying boat kiyomi agrees to watch over  the children in her stead after saying  goodbye to annie who intends to stay  behind pique and reiner join the survey  corps hainge gives them the opportunity  to stay behind but the two insist that  they are continuing until the end  preparations for departure are  interrupted by flock who damages the  boat's fuel tank necessitating time for  repairs to be done as aaron's titans  arrive in odaha hange stays behind to  hold them off while peek and the others  board the boat and depart  as the flying boat reaches aaron it  comes under fire from the beast titan as  the rest of the group jump from the boat  peak grabs the explosives and drags them  out of the boat with her transforming  mid air  pique transports the explosive in her 